      "values:originalText": "instrument proposing to designate a sector\n\n(1) When the Commission is consulted under subsection 56AD(2), the\nCommission must:\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ae-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
