    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56af-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56AF(3) Information Commissioner must analyse and report about an",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56af-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In deciding whether or not to exclude a part of the report from\npublication, the Information Commissioner must:\n\n(a) have regard to the need to prevent the matters in\nsubsection 33(2) of the Privacy Act 1988; and\n\n(b) try to achieve an appropriate balance between the need to\nprevent those matters and the desirability of ensuring that\ninterested persons are sufficiently informed of the\nInformation Commissioner’s analysis in the report.\n\nConsumer data right  Schedule 1\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 63, 2019\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019\n\n56AG  Commission may recommend that a sector be designated etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In deciding whether or not to exclude a part of the report from\npublication, the Information Commissioner must:\n\n(a) have regard to the need to prevent the matters in\nsubsection 33(2) of the Privacy Act 1988; and\n\n(b) try to achieve an appropriate balance between the need to\nprevent those matters and the desirability of ensuring that\ninterested persons are sufficiently informed of the\nInformation Commissioner’s analysis in the report.\n\nConsumer data right  Schedule 1\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 63, 2019\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019\n\n56AG  Commission may recommend that a sector be designated etc.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56af"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
