    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56af-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56AF(1) Information Commissioner must analyse and report about an",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56af-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commission may, in writing, recommend to the Minister that\nthe Minister make an instrument under subsection 56AC(2):\n\n(a) designating a particular sector of the Australian economy; or\n\n(b) varying or revoking an instrument designating a sector under\nthat subsection.\nThe Commission must publish the recommendation on its website.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Commission may, in writing, recommend to the Minister that\nthe Minister make an instrument under subsection 56AC(2):\n\n(a) designating a particular sector of the Australian economy; or\n\n(b) varying or revoking an instrument designating a sector under\nthat subsection.\nThe Commission must publish the recommendation on its website.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56af"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56af-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56af-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56af-ss-1-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5c1e98f16494b257d396071f6ea368ba823e64b2809233b5dc340bd9d56bc770",
      "skos:note": "Must analyse and report on the effect of an instrument on consumer privacy. The Commission must publish a recommendation on its website.",
      "dc:description": "Analysis and report to the Minister"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56af-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56AF(1) Information Commissioner must analyse and report about an",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 12,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Commission may, in writing, recommend to the Minister that\nthe Minister make an instrument under subsection 56AC(2):\n\n(a) designating a particular sector of the Australian economy; or\n\n(b) varying or revoking an instrument designating a sector under\nthat subsection.\nThe Commission must publish the recommendation on its website."
    },
