    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56am",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56AM Meanings of chargeable CDR data, chargeable circumstances",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56am"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.17",
      "values:originalText": "and fee-free CDR data\n\n(1) CDR data is chargeable CDR data if the CDR data is information\nwithin a class specified, as described in paragraph 56AC(2)(d), in\nan instrument designating a sector under subsection 56AC(2) (the\ndesignation instrument).\n\n(2) The chargeable CDR data is disclosed in chargeable\ncircumstances if it is disclosed in circumstances specified:\n\n(a) for that class of information; and\n\n(b) as described in subparagraph 56AC(2)(d)(i);\nin the designation instrument.\n\n(3) The chargeable CDR data is used in chargeable circumstances if it\nis used in circumstances specified:\n\n(a) for that class of information; and\n\n(b) as described in subparagraph 56AC(2)(d)(ii);\nin the designation instrument.\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "skos:definition": "and fee-free CDR data\n\n(1) CDR data is chargeable CDR data if the CDR data is information\nwithin a class specified, as described in paragraph 56AC(2)(d), in\nan instrument designating a sector under subsection 56AC(2) (the\ndesignation instrument).\n\n(2) The chargeable CDR data is disclosed in chargeable\ncircumstances if it is disclosed in circumstances specified:\n\n(a) for that class of information; and\n\n(b) as described in subparagraph 56AC(2)(d)(i);\nin the designation instrument.\n\n(3) The chargeable CDR data is used in chargeable circumstances if it\nis used in circumstances specified:\n\n(a) for that class of information; and\n\n(b) as described in subparagraph 56AC(2)(d)(ii);\nin the designation instrument.\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56am-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56am-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56am-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "cd56d4d967b15472da25f7afdd0c7ffd1a1dda9ba1fe4102b9805fbbf7d0446d"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56am",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56AM Meanings of chargeable CDR data, chargeable circumstances",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 17,
      "values:originalText": "and fee-free CDR data\n\n(1) CDR data is chargeable CDR data if the CDR data is information\nwithin a class specified, as described in paragraph 56AC(2)(d), in\nan instrument designating a sector under subsection 56AC(2) (the\ndesignation instrument).\n\n(2) The chargeable CDR data is disclosed in chargeable\ncircumstances if it is disclosed in circumstances specified:\n\n(a) for that class of information; and\n\n(b) as described in subparagraph 56AC(2)(d)(i);\nin the designation instrument.\n\n(3) The chargeable CDR data is used in chargeable circumstances if it\nis used in circumstances specified:\n\n(a) for that class of information; and\n\n(b) as described in subparagraph 56AC(2)(d)(ii);\nin the designation instrument.\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56am-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
