      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.17",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The chargeable CDR data is used in chargeable circumstances if it\nis used in circumstances specified:\n\n(a) for that class of information; and\n\n(b) as described in subparagraph 56AC(2)(d)(ii);\nin the designation instrument.\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The chargeable CDR data is used in chargeable circumstances if it\nis used in circumstances specified:\n\n(a) for that class of information; and\n\n(b) as described in subparagraph 56AC(2)(d)(ii);\nin the designation instrument.\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
