      "skos:note": "Chargeable CDR data is used in chargeable circumstances if it meets specified conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56am-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56AM(3) Meanings of chargeable CDR data, chargeable circumstances",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 17,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The chargeable CDR data is used in chargeable circumstances if it\nis used in circumstances specified:\n\n(a) for that class of information; and\n\n(b) as described in subparagraph 56AC(2)(d)(ii);\nin the designation instrument.\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56am-ss-3-norm",
