    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ar-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56AR(2) Government entities may participate under this Part",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56ar-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The CDR provisions apply only in relation to an entity that:\n\n(a) is part of a State or Territory; or\n\n(b) is a body (whether or not incorporated) established for a\npublic purpose by or under a law of a State or Territory; or\n\n(c) is:\n\n(i) holding or performing the duties of an office established\nby or under a law of a State or Territory; or\n\n(ii) holding an appointment made under a law of a State or\nTerritory; or\n\n(d) is an entity prescribed by the regulations in relation to a State\nor Territory;\nif a declaration under subsection 56AS(1), that the entity is a\nparticipating entity for the State or Territory, is in force.\nNote:\nFor how the CDR provisions so apply, see subsection (4).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The CDR provisions apply only in relation to an entity that:\n\n(a) is part of a State or Territory; or\n\n(b) is a body (whether or not incorporated) established for a\npublic purpose by or under a law of a State or Territory; or\n\n(c) is:\n\n(i) holding or performing the duties of an office established\nby or under a law of a State or Territory; or\n\n(ii) holding an appointment made under a law of a State or\nTerritory; or\n\n(d) is an entity prescribed by the regulations in relation to a State\nor Territory;\nif a declaration under subsection 56AS(1), that the entity is a\nparticipating entity for the State or Territory, is in force.\nNote:\nFor how the CDR provisions so apply, see subsection (4).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ar"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ar-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ar-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ea419ab2129ab9cda73a2f7bea1650a8e3cee681b2079f519814c7da6013b27c",
      "skos:note": "Entity must be a participating entity for the State or Territory to apply CDR provisions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56ar-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56AR(2) Government entities may participate under this Part",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The CDR provisions apply only in relation to an entity that:\n\n(a) is part of a State or Territory; or\n\n(b) is a body (whether or not incorporated) established for a\npublic purpose by or under a law of a State or Territory; or\n\n(c) is:\n\n(i) holding or performing the duties of an office established\nby or under a law of a State or Territory; or\n\n(ii) holding an appointment made under a law of a State or\nTerritory; or\n\n(d) is an entity prescribed by the regulations in relation to a State\nor Territory;\nif a declaration under subsection 56AS(1), that the entity is a\nparticipating entity for the State or Territory, is in force.\nNote:\nFor how the CDR provisions so apply, see subsection (4)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ar-ss-2-norm",
