    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ar-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56AR(4) Government entities may participate under this Part",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56ar-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For an entity covered by subsection (1), (2) or (3), the CDR\nprovisions apply as described in that subsection in relation to the\nentity:\n\n(a) as if the entity were a person; and\n\n(b) with the modifications (if any) prescribed by the regulations.\nThis subsection does not affect how subsection 56AQ(2) applies to\nthe entity.\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For an entity covered by subsection (1), (2) or (3), the CDR\nprovisions apply as described in that subsection in relation to the\nentity:\n\n(a) as if the entity were a person; and\n\n(b) with the modifications (if any) prescribed by the regulations.\nThis subsection does not affect how subsection 56AQ(2) applies to\nthe entity.\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ar"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ar-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ar-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "96c2af9e23c2220490b7ea43de7d54c722f897c596344dea511bfb1dbfca80d0",
      "skos:note": "Government entities must comply with CDR provisions as if they were a person."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56ar-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56AR(4) Government entities may participate under this Part",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For an entity covered by subsection (1), (2) or (3), the CDR\nprovisions apply as described in that subsection in relation to the\nentity:\n\n(a) as if the entity were a person; and\n\n(b) with the modifications (if any) prescribed by the regulations.\nThis subsection does not affect how subsection 56AQ(2) applies to\nthe entity.\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right"
    },
    {
