    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bb",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56BB Matters that the consumer data rules may deal with",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56bb"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.23",
      "values:originalText": "The consumer data rules may deal with the following matters:\n\n(a) disclosure, collection, use, accuracy, storage, security or\ndeletion of CDR data for which there are one or more CDR\nconsumers (see also sections 56BC and 56BD);\n\n(b) disclosure, collection, use, accuracy, storage, security or\ndeletion of CDR data for which there are no CDR consumers\n(see also sections 56BE and 56BF);\n\n(c) designated gateways for CDR data (see also section 56BG);\n\n(d) accreditation of data recipients (see also section 56BH);\n\n(e) reporting, record keeping and auditing (see also\nsection 56BI);\n\n(f) matters incidental or related to any of the above matters (see\nalso section 56BJ).\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "skos:definition": "The consumer data rules may deal with the following matters:\n\n(a) disclosure, collection, use, accuracy, storage, security or\ndeletion of CDR data for which there are one or more CDR\nconsumers (see also sections 56BC and 56BD);\n\n(b) disclosure, collection, use, accuracy, storage, security or\ndeletion of CDR data for which there are no CDR consumers\n(see also sections 56BE and 56BF);\n\n(c) designated gateways for CDR data (see also section 56BG);\n\n(d) accreditation of data recipients (see also section 56BH);\n\n(e) reporting, record keeping and auditing (see also\nsection 56BI);\n\n(f) matters incidental or related to any of the above matters (see\nalso section 56BJ).\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bb-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f9eb2e3f47979c1f158454b64e5bceb9abc1c512a19613f0950b67a80939cb59",
      "skos:note": "Matters that the consumer data rules may deal with"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56bb",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56BB Matters that the consumer data rules may deal with",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 23,
      "values:originalText": "The consumer data rules may deal with the following matters:\n\n(a) disclosure, collection, use, accuracy, storage, security or\ndeletion of CDR data for which there are one or more CDR\nconsumers (see also sections 56BC and 56BD);\n\n(b) disclosure, collection, use, accuracy, storage, security or\ndeletion of CDR data for which there are no CDR consumers\n(see also sections 56BE and 56BF);\n\n(c) designated gateways for CDR data (see also section 56BG);\n\n(d) accreditation of data recipients (see also section 56BH);\n\n(e) reporting, record keeping and auditing (see also\nsection 56BI);\n\n(f) matters incidental or related to any of the above matters (see\nalso section 56BJ).\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right"
    },
