    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bd",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56BD Limitations for rules about CDR data for which there are",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56bd"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.25",
      "values:originalText": "CDR consumers\nOnly designated CDR data can be required to be disclosed\n\n(1) The consumer data rules can only require a disclosure of CDR data\nfor which there are one or more CDR consumers if:\n\n(a) the CDR data is within a class of information specified, as\ndescribed in paragraph 56AC(2)(a), in an instrument\ndesignating a sector under subsection 56AC(2); and\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "skos:definition": "CDR consumers\nOnly designated CDR data can be required to be disclosed\n\n(1) The consumer data rules can only require a disclosure of CDR data\nfor which there are one or more CDR consumers if:\n\n(a) the CDR data is within a class of information specified, as\ndescribed in paragraph 56AC(2)(a), in an instrument\ndesignating a sector under subsection 56AC(2); and\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bd-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bd-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bd-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "57b429b0f700c6234e2a091c1d78f75d9b4497284dbe0bcd769dfccb6552410d",
      "skos:note": "Only designated CDR data can be required to be disclosed for which there are one or more CDR consumers."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56bd",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56BD Limitations for rules about CDR data for which there are",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 25,
      "values:originalText": "CDR consumers\nOnly designated CDR data can be required to be disclosed\n\n(1) The consumer data rules can only require a disclosure of CDR data\nfor which there are one or more CDR consumers if:\n\n(a) the CDR data is within a class of information specified, as\ndescribed in paragraph 56AC(2)(a), in an instrument\ndesignating a sector under subsection 56AC(2); and\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bd-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bd"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
