      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.39",
      "values:originalText": "(2) However, a failure to comply with paragraph (1)(a) does not\ninvalidate rules made as described in subsection (1).\nNote:\nSuch rules may have a limited life (see subsection 56BT(3)).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) However, a failure to comply with paragraph (1)(a) does not\ninvalidate rules made as described in subsection (1).\nNote:\nSuch rules may have a limited life (see subsection 56BT(3)).",
      "values:partOf": {
