    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bw",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56BW Review by the Tribunal of determinations specifying",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56bw"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.42",
      "values:originalText": "particular CDR participants\n\n(1) If the Commission makes a determination under\nsubsection 56BV(1) in the way described in subsection 56BV(5):\n\n(a) the CDR participant specified in the determination; or\n\n(b) a person whose interests are affected by the determination;\nmay apply in writing to the Tribunal for a review of the\ndetermination.\n\n(2) An application under this section for a review of a determination\nmust be made within 21 days after the day the Commission made\nthe determination.\n\n(3) If the Tribunal receives an application under this section for a\nreview of a determination, the Tribunal must review the\ndetermination.\n\nConsumer data right  Schedule 1\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 63, 2019\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019",
      "skos:definition": "particular CDR participants\n\n(1) If the Commission makes a determination under\nsubsection 56BV(1) in the way described in subsection 56BV(5):\n\n(a) the CDR participant specified in the determination; or\n\n(b) a person whose interests are affected by the determination;\nmay apply in writing to the Tribunal for a review of the\ndetermination.\n\n(2) An application under this section for a review of a determination\nmust be made within 21 days after the day the Commission made\nthe determination.\n\n(3) If the Tribunal receives an application under this section for a\nreview of a determination, the Tribunal must review the\ndetermination.\n\nConsumer data right  Schedule 1\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 63, 2019\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bw-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bw-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bw-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "91e5ed5cb4f0a64ba44e6866accb9ea01d14b4ed265ce77e57a41a7644777ccb"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56bw",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56BW Review by the Tribunal of determinations specifying",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 42,
      "values:originalText": "particular CDR participants\n\n(1) If the Commission makes a determination under\nsubsection 56BV(1) in the way described in subsection 56BV(5):\n\n(a) the CDR participant specified in the determination; or\n\n(b) a person whose interests are affected by the determination;\nmay apply in writing to the Tribunal for a review of the\ndetermination.\n\n(2) An application under this section for a review of a determination\nmust be made within 21 days after the day the Commission made\nthe determination.\n\n(3) If the Tribunal receives an application under this section for a\nreview of a determination, the Tribunal must review the\ndetermination.\n\nConsumer data right  Schedule 1\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 63, 2019\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019"
    },
