      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.42",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If the Tribunal receives an application under this section for a\nreview of a determination, the Tribunal must review the\ndetermination.\n\nConsumer data right  Schedule 1\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 63, 2019\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If the Tribunal receives an application under this section for a\nreview of a determination, the Tribunal must review the\ndetermination.\n\nConsumer data right  Schedule 1\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 63, 2019\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019",
