      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of a review, the Tribunal may have regard to any\ninformation given, documents produced or evidence given to the\nCommission in connection with the making of the determination to\nwhich the review relates.\nNote:\nDivision 2 of Part IX applies to proceedings before the Tribunal.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purposes of a review, the Tribunal may have regard to any\ninformation given, documents produced or evidence given to the\nCommission in connection with the making of the determination to\nwhich the review relates.\nNote:\nDivision 2 of Part IX applies to proceedings before the Tribunal.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bx"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bx-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56bx-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5b777b1ffc1048557e2ede3cd79249154509fb2a582319bf3fdadc312049a9a8",
      "skos:note": "May consider information given to Commission in review"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56bx-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56BX(4) Functions and powers of Tribunal",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 43,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of a review, the Tribunal may have regard to any\ninformation given, documents produced or evidence given to the\nCommission in connection with the making of the determination to\nwhich the review relates.\nNote:\nDivision 2 of Part IX applies to proceedings before the Tribunal."
    },
