      "cml:premiseText": "(1) The Minister may, by written instrument, appoint as the Data\nRecipient Accreditor a person who:\n\n(a) is the accountable authority of a Commonwealth entity\n(within the meaning of the Public Governance, Performance\nand Accountability Act 2013);"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56cg-ss-1-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
