    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ch-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56CH(4) Functions, powers and annual report",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56ch-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.46",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If:\n\n(a) a person is the Data Recipient Accreditor at any time during a\nperiod; and\n\n(b) an annual report for the period is prepared under section 46\nof the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability\nAct 2013:\n\n(i) by the person in the person’s primary capacity; or\n\n(ii) about the person in the person’s primary capacity;\nthe annual report must include information about the performance\nof the Data Recipient Accreditor’s functions, and the exercise of\nthe Data Recipient Accreditor’s powers, at that time.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If:\n\n(a) a person is the Data Recipient Accreditor at any time during a\nperiod; and\n\n(b) an annual report for the period is prepared under section 46\nof the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability\nAct 2013:\n\n(i) by the person in the person’s primary capacity; or\n\n(ii) about the person in the person’s primary capacity;\nthe annual report must include information about the performance\nof the Data Recipient Accreditor’s functions, and the exercise of\nthe Data Recipient Accreditor’s powers, at that time.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ch"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ch-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ch-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a78174997b2ec10b106c5c3ed8f43911e2a797f1115514862fba116a1da30550",
      "skos:note": "Annual report must include information about the performance of the Data Recipient Accreditor's functions and powers.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56ch-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56CH(4) Functions, powers and annual report",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 46,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If:\n\n(a) a person is the Data Recipient Accreditor at any time during a\nperiod; and\n\n(b) an annual report for the period is prepared under section 46\nof the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability\nAct 2013:\n\n(i) by the person in the person’s primary capacity; or\n\n(ii) about the person in the person’s primary capacity;\nthe annual report must include information about the performance\nof the Data Recipient Accreditor’s functions, and the exercise of\nthe Data Recipient Accreditor’s powers, at that time."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ch-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
