    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ci",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56CI Directions by Minister",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56ci"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.47",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, give written directions\nto the Data Recipient Accreditor about the performance of its\nfunctions and the exercise of its powers.\nNote:\nSection 42 (disallowance) and Part 4 of Chapter 3 (sunsetting) of the\nLegislation Act 2003 do not apply to the directions (see regulations\nmade for the purposes of paragraphs 44(2)(b) and 54(2)(b) of that\nAct).\n\n(2) A direction under subsection (1) must be of a general nature only.\n\n(3) The Data Recipient Accreditor must comply with a direction under\nsubsection (1).\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, give written directions\nto the Data Recipient Accreditor about the performance of its\nfunctions and the exercise of its powers.\nNote:\nSection 42 (disallowance) and Part 4 of Chapter 3 (sunsetting) of the\nLegislation Act 2003 do not apply to the directions (see regulations\nmade for the purposes of paragraphs 44(2)(b) and 54(2)(b) of that\nAct).\n\n(2) A direction under subsection (1) must be of a general nature only.\n\n(3) The Data Recipient Accreditor must comply with a direction under\nsubsection (1).\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ci-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ci-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ci-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6ebb46d0001e46af6fd6fbf4f0b014b03629f9f830d386d63c4a0be568d00156"
    },
    {
