      "cml:premiseText": "(2) The Accreditation Registrar has the power to do all other things\nnecessary or convenient to be done for or in connection with the\nperformance of the Accreditation Registrar’s functions.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The power is exercised during the performance of the Accreditation Registrar’s functions."
