    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56cl-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56CL(4) Functions, powers and annual report",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56cl-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.48",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If:\n\n(a) a person is the Accreditation Registrar at any time during a\nperiod; and\n\n(b) an annual report for the period is prepared under section 46\nof the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability\nAct 2013:\n\n(i) by the person in the person’s primary capacity; or\n\n(ii) about the person in the person’s primary capacity;\nthe annual report must include information about the performance\nof the Accreditation Registrar’s functions, and the exercise of the\nAccreditation Registrar’s powers, at that time.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If:\n\n(a) a person is the Accreditation Registrar at any time during a\nperiod; and\n\n(b) an annual report for the period is prepared under section 46\nof the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability\nAct 2013:\n\n(i) by the person in the person’s primary capacity; or\n\n(ii) about the person in the person’s primary capacity;\nthe annual report must include information about the performance\nof the Accreditation Registrar’s functions, and the exercise of the\nAccreditation Registrar’s powers, at that time.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56cl"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56cl-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56cl-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d211f73e6eae4bed899dc0cf37ed0aa4305111a3f1ad1ca78c9a85b92e7cdd61",
      "skos:note": "Annual report must include information about Accreditation Registrar's functions and powers.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56cl-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56CL(4) Functions, powers and annual report",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 48,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If:\n\n(a) a person is the Accreditation Registrar at any time during a\nperiod; and\n\n(b) an annual report for the period is prepared under section 46\nof the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability\nAct 2013:\n\n(i) by the person in the person’s primary capacity; or\n\n(ii) about the person in the person’s primary capacity;\nthe annual report must include information about the performance\nof the Accreditation Registrar’s functions, and the exercise of the\nAccreditation Registrar’s powers, at that time."
    },
