    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56eb",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56EB Kinds of CDR data to which the privacy safeguards apply",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56eb"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.52",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The privacy safeguards only apply to CDR data for which there are\none or more CDR consumers.\nNote:\nOne requirement for CDR data to have a CDR consumer is that there\nneeds to be at least one person who is identifiable, or reasonably\nidentifiable, from the CDR data or from related information (see\nparagraph 56AI(3)(c)).\n\n(2) The privacy safeguards apply to CDR data whether the CDR data\nis true or not.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The privacy safeguards only apply to CDR data for which there are\none or more CDR consumers.\nNote:\nOne requirement for CDR data to have a CDR consumer is that there\nneeds to be at least one person who is identifiable, or reasonably\nidentifiable, from the CDR data or from related information (see\nparagraph 56AI(3)(c)).\n\n(2) The privacy safeguards apply to CDR data whether the CDR data\nis true or not.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56eb-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56eb-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0c7980d812a3e3e66909b690d253f67441988ca050e4049c575fc6e3c7ebbbe7"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56eb",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56EB Kinds of CDR data to which the privacy safeguards apply",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 52,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The privacy safeguards only apply to CDR data for which there are\none or more CDR consumers.\nNote:\nOne requirement for CDR data to have a CDR consumer is that there\nneeds to be at least one person who is identifiable, or reasonably\nidentifiable, from the CDR data or from related information (see\nparagraph 56AI(3)(c)).\n\n(2) The privacy safeguards apply to CDR data whether the CDR data\nis true or not."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56eb-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56EB(1) Kinds of CDR data to which the privacy safeguards apply",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
