      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.54",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If the CDR entity is a designated gateway for any CDR data, the\nCDR entity’s policy must contain the following information:\n\n(a) an explanation of how the CDR entity, as a designated\ngateway, will act between persons to facilitate:\n\n(i) the disclosure of CDR data; or\n\n(ii) the accuracy of CDR data; or\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If the CDR entity is a designated gateway for any CDR data, the\nCDR entity’s policy must contain the following information:\n\n(a) an explanation of how the CDR entity, as a designated\ngateway, will act between persons to facilitate:\n\n(i) the disclosure of CDR data; or\n\n(ii) the accuracy of CDR data; or\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
