      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 56,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subsection (1) does not apply in the circumstances specified in the\nconsumer data rules.\n\nConsumer data right  Schedule 1\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 63, 2019\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019\n\nSubdivision C—Collecting CDR data"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ee-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56ee-ss-3"
      },
