      "values:originalText": "(2) Subsection (1) applies whether the collection is directly from the\nCDR participant or indirectly from the CDR participant through a\ndesignated gateway for the CDR data.\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Subsection (1) applies whether the collection is directly from the\nCDR participant or indirectly from the CDR participant through a\ndesignated gateway for the CDR data.\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "values:partOf": {
