      "values:originalText": "(2) Subsection (1) applies whether the collection is directly from the\nCDR participant or indirectly from the CDR participant through a\ndesignated gateway for the CDR data.\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56eg-ss-2-norm",
