    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56er",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56ER Information Commissioner may conduct an assessment",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56er"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.67",
      "values:originalText": "relating to the management and handling of CDR data\n\n(1) The Information Commissioner may assess whether a CDR\nparticipant, or designated gateway, for CDR data is maintaining\nand handling the CDR data in accordance with:\n\n(a) the privacy safeguards; or\n\n(b) the consumer data rules to the extent that those rules relate to:\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "skos:definition": "relating to the management and handling of CDR data\n\n(1) The Information Commissioner may assess whether a CDR\nparticipant, or designated gateway, for CDR data is maintaining\nand handling the CDR data in accordance with:\n\n(a) the privacy safeguards; or\n\n(b) the consumer data rules to the extent that those rules relate to:\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56er-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56er-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4e1308146f6a11799e25c4f1f0306304ded734c44ca1ec5adab5d72eea2bf9bb",
      "skos:note": "The Information Commissioner may assess whether a CDR participant or designated gateway is maintaining and handling CDR data in accordance with privacy safeguards."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56er",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56ER Information Commissioner may conduct an assessment",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 67,
      "values:originalText": "relating to the management and handling of CDR data\n\n(1) The Information Commissioner may assess whether a CDR\nparticipant, or designated gateway, for CDR data is maintaining\nand handling the CDR data in accordance with:\n\n(a) the privacy safeguards; or\n\n(b) the consumer data rules to the extent that those rules relate to:\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56er-norm",
