      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.68",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of subsection (2), assume that:\n\n(a) sections 26WB to 26WD of the Privacy Act 1988 were not\nenacted; and\n\n(b) subsection 26WE(1) of that Act were replaced with the\nfollowing:\n“Scope",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of subsection (2), assume that:\n\n(a) sections 26WB to 26WD of the Privacy Act 1988 were not\nenacted; and\n\n(b) subsection 26WE(1) of that Act were replaced with the\nfollowing:\n“Scope",
