    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56es-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56ES(1) Notification of CDR data security breaches",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56es-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.68",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) CDR data of one or more CDR consumers is held by (or on\nbehalf of) either of the following entities (the CDR entity):\n\n(i) an accredited data recipient of the CDR data;\n\n(ii) a designated gateway for the CDR data; and\n\n(b) section 56EO (about privacy safeguard 12) of the\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010 applies to the CDR\nentity in relation to the CDR data.”.\n56ET  Investigating breaches of the privacy safeguards etc.\nBreaches to which this section applies",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) CDR data of one or more CDR consumers is held by (or on\nbehalf of) either of the following entities (the CDR entity):\n\n(i) an accredited data recipient of the CDR data;\n\n(ii) a designated gateway for the CDR data; and\n\n(b) section 56EO (about privacy safeguard 12) of the\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010 applies to the CDR\nentity in relation to the CDR data.”.\n56ET  Investigating breaches of the privacy safeguards etc.\nBreaches to which this section applies",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56es"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
