    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56es-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56ES(1) Notification of CDR data security breaches",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56es-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.68",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to a breach (a privacy safeguard breach) of\nany of the following:\n\n(a) one or more of the privacy safeguards;\n\n(b) the consumer data rules to the extent that those rules relate:\n\n(i) to one or more of the privacy safeguards; or\n\n(ii) to the privacy or confidentiality of CDR data;\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies to a breach (a privacy safeguard breach) of\nany of the following:\n\n(a) one or more of the privacy safeguards;\n\n(b) the consumer data rules to the extent that those rules relate:\n\n(i) to one or more of the privacy safeguards; or\n\n(ii) to the privacy or confidentiality of CDR data;\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56es"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
