    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56eu-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56EU(5) Civil penalty provisions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56eu-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.72",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If an act or omission constitutes:\n\n(a) a contravention of one or more of the privacy safeguard\npenalty provisions; and\n\n(b) a contravention of one or more civil penalty provisions of the\nconsumer data rules;\nproceedings may be instituted against a person in relation to the\ncontravention of any one or more of those provisions.\nNote 1:\nThe proceedings for a contravention referred to in paragraph (a) would\nbe instituted under Part 4 of the Regulatory Powers Act.\nNote 2:\nThe proceedings for a contravention referred to in paragraph (b)\nwould be instituted under Part VI of this Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If an act or omission constitutes:\n\n(a) a contravention of one or more of the privacy safeguard\npenalty provisions; and\n\n(b) a contravention of one or more civil penalty provisions of the\nconsumer data rules;\nproceedings may be instituted against a person in relation to the\ncontravention of any one or more of those provisions.\nNote 1:\nThe proceedings for a contravention referred to in paragraph (a) would\nbe instituted under Part 4 of the Regulatory Powers Act.\nNote 2:\nThe proceedings for a contravention referred to in paragraph (b)\nwould be instituted under Part VI of this Act.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56eu"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56eu-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
