      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibition",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibits proceedings against a person in relation to contravention of certain provisions.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) If an act or omission constitutes:\n\n(a) a contravention of one or more of the privacy safeguard\npenalty provisions; and\n\n(b) a contravention of one or more civil penalty provisions of the\nconsumer data rules;\nproceedings may be instituted against a person in relation to the\ncontravention of any one or more of those provisions.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Proceedings may not be instituted against a person in relation to contravention of certain provisions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56eu-ss-5-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Overlaps",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Identifies the temporal overlap between the provision and the regulatory powers act.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Note 1:\nThe proceedings for a contravention referred to in paragraph (a) would\nbe instituted under Part 4 of the Regulatory Powers Act.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The provision overlaps with Part 4 of the Regulatory Powers Act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56eu-ss-5-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Repeats",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Identifies the recurring nature of the provision.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Note 2:\nThe proceedings for a contravention referred to in paragraph (b)\nwould be instituted under Part VI of this Act.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The provision repeats with Part VI of this Act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56eu-ss-5-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Imposes an obligation to institute proceedings against a person in relation to contravention of certain provisions.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) If an act or omission constitutes:\n\n(a) a contravention of one or more of the privacy safeguard\npenalty provisions; and\n\n(b) a contravention of one or more civil penalty provisions of the\nconsumer data rules;\nproceedings may be instituted against a person in relation to the\ncontravention of any one or more of those provisions.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "There is an obligation to institute proceedings against a person in relation to contravention of certain provisions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56eu-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56EU(6) Civil penalty provisions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56eu-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.72",
      "values:originalText": "(6) However, the person is not liable to more than one pecuniary\npenalty under:\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "skos:definition": "(6) However, the person is not liable to more than one pecuniary\npenalty under:\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56eu"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
