      "cof:title": "56EV(4) Civil penalty provisions—maximum amount of penalty",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 74,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (1), the maximum penalty amount\nfor a contravention by a person other than a body corporate of a\nprivacy safeguard penalty provision is $500,000."
