      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.76",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The finding or admission may be proved by production of:\n\n(a) in any case—a document under the seal of the court from\nwhich the finding or admission appears; or\n\n(b) in the case of an admission—a document from which the\nadmission appears that is filed in the court.\nJurisdiction etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The finding or admission may be proved by production of:\n\n(a) in any case—a document under the seal of the court from\nwhich the finding or admission appears; or\n\n(b) in the case of an admission—a document from which the\nadmission appears that is filed in the court.\nJurisdiction etc.",
      "values:partOf": {
