      "values:originalText": "(6) Section 86AA (about limits on jurisdiction) applies to proceedings\nunder subsection (1) of this section in a corresponding way to the\nway that section applies to proceedings under section 82.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) Section 86AA (about limits on jurisdiction) applies to proceedings\nunder subsection (1) of this section in a corresponding way to the\nway that section applies to proceedings under section 82.",
