      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.80",
      "values:originalText": "The Data Standards Chair must publish on the internet a copy of\neach data standard made under subsection 56FA(1).\nNote:\nOnce published, the data standards will be available for free.",
      "skos:definition": "The Data Standards Chair must publish on the internet a copy of\neach data standard made under subsection 56FA(1).\nNote:\nOnce published, the data standards will be available for free.",
