      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56fd-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56FD(3) Legal effect of data standards",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 80,
      "values:originalText": "(3) However, if there is an inconsistency between a data standard, and\nthe consumer data rules, those rules prevail over the standard to the\nextent of the inconsistency."
    },
