    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56fe",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56FE Enforcement of binding data standards",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56fe"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.81",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If a person who is under an obligation to comply with a binding\ndata standard fails to meet that obligation, an application to the\nCourt may be made by:\n\n(a) the Commission; or\n\n(b) a person aggrieved by the failure.\n\n(2) After giving an opportunity to be heard to the applicant and the\nperson against whom the order is sought, the Court may make an\norder giving directions to:\n\n(a) the person against whom the order is sought; or\n\n(b) if that person is a body corporate—the directors of the body\ncorporate;\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If a person who is under an obligation to comply with a binding\ndata standard fails to meet that obligation, an application to the\nCourt may be made by:\n\n(a) the Commission; or\n\n(b) a person aggrieved by the failure.\n\n(2) After giving an opportunity to be heard to the applicant and the\nperson against whom the order is sought, the Court may make an\norder giving directions to:\n\n(a) the person against whom the order is sought; or\n\n(b) if that person is a body corporate—the directors of the body\ncorporate;\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56fe-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-56fe-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4506af6af836fe7f083adcc899c5824c67aad94dba7c6d62f0c667eb30a585e3"
    },
