      "skos:definition": "(3) An exemption under paragraph (2)(a) or (b), or a declaration under\nparagraph (2)(c):\n\n(a) may or may not be limited to a specified period; and\n\nConsumer data right  Schedule 1\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 63, 2019\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019\n\n(b) may apply unconditionally or subject to specified conditions.",
