    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-56ge-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56GE(3) Exemptions and modifications by regulations",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 90,
      "values:originalText": "(3) An exemption under paragraph (2)(a) or (b), or a declaration under\nparagraph (2)(c):\n\n(a) may or may not be limited to a specified period; and\n\nConsumer data right  Schedule 1\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 63, 2019\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019\n\n(b) may apply unconditionally or subject to specified conditions."
    },
