      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.91",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The CDR provisions also have the effect they would have if their\noperation were expressly confined to CDR entities acting in the\ncourse of, or in relation to, any of the following:\n\n(a) trade or commerce between Australia and places outside\nAustralia;\n\n(b) trade or commerce among the States;\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The CDR provisions also have the effect they would have if their\noperation were expressly confined to CDR entities acting in the\ncourse of, or in relation to, any of the following:\n\n(a) trade or commerce between Australia and places outside\nAustralia;\n\n(b) trade or commerce among the States;\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "values:partOf": {
