    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3 Transitional—energy sector",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.94",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nSubsections 56AD(2) and (3) and sections 56AE and 56AF of the\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010 do not apply in relation to an\ninstrument under subsection 56AC(2) of that Act that:\n\n(a) is to specify matters including one or more of the following:\n\n(i) one or more, or one or more classes of, Registered\nparticipants (within the meaning of the National\nElectricity Law);\n\n(ii) the Australian Energy Regulator;\n\n(iii) Australian Energy Market Operator Limited (ACN",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nSubsections 56AD(2) and (3) and sections 56AE and 56AF of the\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010 do not apply in relation to an\ninstrument under subsection 56AC(2) of that Act that:\n\n(a) is to specify matters including one or more of the following:\n\n(i) one or more, or one or more classes of, Registered\nparticipants (within the meaning of the National\nElectricity Law);\n\n(ii) the Australian Energy Regulator;\n\n(iii) Australian Energy Market Operator Limited (ACN",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "df7fd30ef92d91b48bcc893f70a628dd412a95ae16efc5eedbeebcc27306ee74",
      "skos:note": "Exemptions for energy sector instruments"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3 Transitional—energy sector",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 94,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nSubsections 56AD(2) and (3) and sections 56AE and 56AF of the\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010 do not apply in relation to an\ninstrument under subsection 56AC(2) of that Act that:\n\n(a) is to specify matters including one or more of the following:\n\n(i) one or more, or one or more classes of, Registered\nparticipants (within the meaning of the National\nElectricity Law);\n\n(ii) the Australian Energy Regulator;\n\n(iii) Australian Energy Market Operator Limited (ACN"
    },
