    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6 Subsection 9(1)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.95",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(1) The privacy functions are functions conferred on the Information\nCommissioner by an Act (or an instrument under an Act), if:\n\n(a) the functions:\n\n(i) relate to the privacy of an individual; and\n\n(ii) are not freedom of information functions; or\n\n(b) the functions are conferred by:\n\n(i) Part IVD (about the consumer data right) of the\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010; or\n\n(ii) an instrument made under that Part; or\n\n(iii) another Act because of that Part.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(1) The privacy functions are functions conferred on the Information\nCommissioner by an Act (or an instrument under an Act), if:\n\n(a) the functions:\n\n(i) relate to the privacy of an individual; and\n\n(ii) are not freedom of information functions; or\n\n(b) the functions are conferred by:\n\n(i) Part IVD (about the consumer data right) of the\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010; or\n\n(ii) an instrument made under that Part; or\n\n(iii) another Act because of that Part.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-6-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ca03905564ea6015beb6560c975fb9a7d91592c64ba512532b8f38557a0777ae",
      "skos:note": "Repeal subsection 9(1) and substitute with new provisions regarding privacy functions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 Subsection 9(1)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 95,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsection, substitute:\n\n(1) The privacy functions are functions conferred on the Information\nCommissioner by an Act (or an instrument under an Act), if:\n\n(a) the functions:\n\n(i) relate to the privacy of an individual; and\n\n(ii) are not freedom of information functions; or\n\n(b) the functions are conferred by:\n\n(i) Part IVD (about the consumer data right) of the\nCompetition and Consumer Act 2010; or\n\n(ii) an instrument made under that Part; or\n\n(iii) another Act because of that Part."
    },
