    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-16",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "16 At the end of section 26",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-16"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.99",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\nDelegations relating to Part IVD or the consumer data rules\n\n(3) The Commission may, by resolution and in accordance with\nsubsection (5), delegate any of its functions and powers under:\n\n(a) Part VI; or\n\n(b) Division 5 of Part XI; or\n\n(c) section 155;\nto the extent that the functions or powers relate to Part IVD or the\nconsumer data rules.\nNote:\nDivision 5 of Part XI relates to the consumer data rules in the way\ndescribed in section 56BM.\n\n(4) A member of the Commission may, by writing and in accordance\nwith subsection (5), delegate any of the member’s functions and\npowers under section 155 to the extent that the functions or powers\nrelate to Part IVD or the consumer data rules.\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\nDelegations relating to Part IVD or the consumer data rules\n\n(3) The Commission may, by resolution and in accordance with\nsubsection (5), delegate any of its functions and powers under:\n\n(a) Part VI; or\n\n(b) Division 5 of Part XI; or\n\n(c) section 155;\nto the extent that the functions or powers relate to Part IVD or the\nconsumer data rules.\nNote:\nDivision 5 of Part XI relates to the consumer data rules in the way\ndescribed in section 56BM.\n\n(4) A member of the Commission may, by writing and in accordance\nwith subsection (5), delegate any of the member’s functions and\npowers under section 155 to the extent that the functions or powers\nrelate to Part IVD or the consumer data rules.\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-16-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-16-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "397628fb2256d3878cc3ed8517042324225c1d5b7bb2adfd8178e72f91dfe68c"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-16",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16 At the end of section 26",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 99,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\nDelegations relating to Part IVD or the consumer data rules\n\n(3) The Commission may, by resolution and in accordance with\nsubsection (5), delegate any of its functions and powers under:\n\n(a) Part VI; or\n\n(b) Division 5 of Part XI; or\n\n(c) section 155;\nto the extent that the functions or powers relate to Part IVD or the\nconsumer data rules.\nNote:\nDivision 5 of Part XI relates to the consumer data rules in the way\ndescribed in section 56BM.\n\n(4) A member of the Commission may, by writing and in accordance\nwith subsection (5), delegate any of the member’s functions and\npowers under section 155 to the extent that the functions or powers\nrelate to Part IVD or the consumer data rules.\n\nSchedule 1  Consumer data right"
    },
