      "values:originalText": "(3) The Commission may, by resolution and in accordance with\nsubsection (5), delegate any of its functions and powers under:\n\n(a) Part VI; or\n\n(b) Division 5 of Part XI; or\n\n(c) section 155;\nto the extent that the functions or powers relate to Part IVD or the\nconsumer data rules.\nNote:\nDivision 5 of Part XI relates to the consumer data rules in the way\ndescribed in section 56BM.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Commission may, by resolution and in accordance with\nsubsection (5), delegate any of its functions and powers under:\n\n(a) Part VI; or\n\n(b) Division 5 of Part XI; or\n\n(c) section 155;\nto the extent that the functions or powers relate to Part IVD or the\nconsumer data rules.\nNote:\nDivision 5 of Part XI relates to the consumer data rules in the way\ndescribed in section 56BM.",
      "values:partOf": {
