      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 100,
      "values:originalText": "Omit “section 55B, 60C, 60K or 92”, substitute “section 55B,\nsubsection 56BN(1), 56BO(1), 56BU(1) or 56CC(1), section 56CD,\n60C, 60K or 92 or a civil penalty provision of the consumer data rules”."
    },
