      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.102",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(b) in which that person has been found to have contravened, or\nto have been involved in a contravention of:\n\n(i) a provision of Part IV or IVB; or\n\n(ii) section 55B, 60C or 60K; or\n\n(iii) subsection 56BO(1) or 56BU(1), section 56CD or a\ncivil penalty provision of the consumer data rules.\n\nConsumer data right  Schedule 1\nOther amendments  Part 2\n\nNo. 63, 2019\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:\n\n(b) in which that person has been found to have contravened, or\nto have been involved in a contravention of:\n\n(i) a provision of Part IV or IVB; or\n\n(ii) section 55B, 60C or 60K; or\n\n(iii) subsection 56BO(1) or 56BU(1), section 56CD or a\ncivil penalty provision of the consumer data rules.\n\nConsumer data right  Schedule 1\nOther amendments  Part 2\n\nNo. 63, 2019\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-33-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-33-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c2a166c3dc72bd6673cbc62b5ab602de9251f075d66d5ef27df35fe1cb125640",
      "skos:note": "Repeal of paragraph 83(1)(b) and substitution with new provision"
    },
