      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.106",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\nConsumer data right  Schedule 1\nOther amendments  Part 2\n\nNo. 63, 2019\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019",
