    {
      "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-79",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "79 After subsection 6E(1C)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-79"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.109",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nSmall business operator that is accredited for the consumer data\nright regime\n\n(1D) If a small business operator holds an accreditation under\nsubsection 56CA(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010,\nthis Act applies, with the prescribed modifications (if any), in\nrelation to information that:\n\n(a) is personal information; but\n\n(b) is not CDR data (within the meaning of that Act);\nas if the small business operator were an organisation.\nNote:\nThe regulations may prescribe different modifications of the Act for\ndifferent small business operators. See subsection 33(3A) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\nSmall business operator that is accredited for the consumer data\nright regime\n\n(1D) If a small business operator holds an accreditation under\nsubsection 56CA(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010,\nthis Act applies, with the prescribed modifications (if any), in\nrelation to information that:\n\n(a) is personal information; but\n\n(b) is not CDR data (within the meaning of that Act);\nas if the small business operator were an organisation.\nNote:\nThe regulations may prescribe different modifications of the Act for\ndifferent small business operators. See subsection 33(3A) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-79-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-79-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-79-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-79-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019-sch-1-sec-79-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "25ce210cd93ce8e8da59ae8cf6f4ceca04994295606b5efac160a188c7356e95",
      "skos:note": "Small business operator with accreditation under subsection 56CA(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 must apply this Act with modifications."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019#sch-1-sec-79",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "79 After subsection 6E(1C)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 109,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nSmall business operator that is accredited for the consumer data\nright regime\n\n(1D) If a small business operator holds an accreditation under\nsubsection 56CA(1) of the Competition and Consumer Act 2010,\nthis Act applies, with the prescribed modifications (if any), in\nrelation to information that:\n\n(a) is personal information; but\n\n(b) is not CDR data (within the meaning of that Act);\nas if the small business operator were an organisation.\nNote:\nThe regulations may prescribe different modifications of the Act for\ndifferent small business operators. See subsection 33(3A) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901."
    },
