      "dc:source": "treasury-laws-amendment-consumer-data-right-act-2019.pdf, p.109",
      "values:originalText": "After “Australian law”, insert “(other than the consumer data rules)”.\n\n\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019\nNo. 63, 2019\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 24 July 2019\nSenate on 31 July 2019]\n\n(126/19)",
      "skos:definition": "After “Australian law”, insert “(other than the consumer data rules)”.\n\n\n\nTreasury Laws Amendment (Consumer Data Right) Act 2019\nNo. 63, 2019\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 24 July 2019\nSenate on 31 July 2019]\n\n(126/19)",
